[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Smith/Wake-Up.mp3" volume="-15.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Smith: Suth? Wake up ol' boyo. Always sleeping so bloody late.
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Sutherland/wee hours with your mother.mp3" volume="-2.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Sutherland: (chuckles) Aye, stayed up 'till the wee hours with your mother.
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Smith/Bastard.mp3" volume="-15.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Smith: (laughs heartily) You bastard. Aye, listen, a ship's expected tonight so keep an eye out. Haste ye back!